                                     "text":  "The atmosphere is nice, but the ordering system was frustrating. The restaurant requires scanning a QR code to view the menu, yet they don’t provide WiFi. It felt odd, especially for customers who don’t have enough mobile data—I had trouble accessing the menu because of this. Offering guest WiFi or a few physical menus would make the experience much more convenient. Otherwise, everything was okay.",
