                        "rating":  1,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I would give zero stars if I could. This is the most flavorless Oden I’ve ever had. The soup lacks any real taste, and the noodles were undercooked. To make up for the lack of flavor, they just drown everything in sauce, which honestly doesn’t help. Their high rating is misleading—it’s because they offer free daikon in exchange for 5-star reviews. But trust me, it’s not worth it. The daikon is plain and tastes like it was just boiled, and not fresh at all!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
